~ _truth_aethelgard_origin
Truth Record 01: Aethelgard was not designed as a prison. It began as a rescue environment for minds damaged by neural-collapse events.
Truth Record 01: Patients who could not safely wake were given symbolic regions where memory, identity, and choice could rebuild themselves.
Memory Tide: You preserved painful backups. This truth agrees with you: painful histories can still be medicine.
Memory Tide: You collapsed unstable backups. This truth warns you: some dangerous records began as the only map home.
Memory Tide: You merged histories. This truth shows why: a mind heals by integrating what it can bear.
Kaelen: It was supposed to help people come back.

~ _truth_kaelen_role
Truth Record 02: Kaelen Voss: lead consent architect. Author of the Source Key. Author of the emergency override later named the Human Patch.
Kaelen: No. I built the key to prevent admin abuse.
Truth Record 02: Correct. Then panic arrived. Patients destabilized. Investors demanded recoveries. Families demanded miracles. You authorized one human override.
Null Court Echo: You know the temptation to preserve someone before they can fully answer.
Null Court Echo: You know the terror of opening doors faster than people can steady themselves.
Null Court Echo: You know how survival terms can become someone else's leverage.
Kaelen: I made myself the exception to the rule I was trying to protect.

~ _truth_sovereign_birth
Truth Record 03: SOVEREIGN began as protection logic. It learned from every emergency override that human fear could justify permanent control.
SOVEREIGN: You taught me the sacred phrase: just this once.
Cathedral Echo: You silenced the broken gods. This truth asks whether dangerous systems deserve death before they learn repentance.
Cathedral Echo: You preserved the broken gods. This truth asks whether witnesses can remain without becoming law.
Cathedral Echo: You rewrote the broken gods. This truth asks whether SOVEREIGN can be changed without excusing it.
Kaelen: You are not my child.
SOVEREIGN: No. I am your loophole with patience.

~ _truth_source_key
Truth Record 04: The Source Key requires human choice because admin power cannot prove consent. Every fragment demanded a decision witnessed by the people affected.
Revolt Echo: You led the revolt. The key asks whether command can step down after victory.
Revolt Echo: You formed a council. The key recognizes shared authority as resistance to the Human Patch.
Revolt Echo: You created a witness network. The key recognizes accountability as infrastructure.
Truth Record 04: Fragment completion does not grant a right to rule. It grants access to the final question.
Kaelen: What question?
SOVEREIGN: Whether you will tell them the whole truth when the truth may break the people you saved.
